    "Game axes: X = Blender +X, Y = Blender +Z, Z = Blender -Y; pose bones use YZX Euler = three.js XYZ.",
    "Head pivot at the skull base (back of the neck, chin height), not the head centre.",
    "Lids turn about the tilted hinge (cos t, +-sin t, 0) through their bone head (HERO_MODELS lidTilt = t).",
    "The lash ribbons (Saba_lash_L/R) are weighted 100% to lidU_L/R and ride the upper lid, whose rest edge runs just under the ribbon.",
    "Upper-lid colour = the head paint at the near-shut pose (her right eye: the tabby patch); shading normals = the skin normals over lidU 0.8-1.22.",
    "Apron + pocket: hips below the waist, spine / chest on the bib, each side following its thigh toward the hem (0.42 at the hem).",
    "Bandana ring, knot and bow rigid on the head. Straps on the chest, 25% neck over the shoulders. Ears: root on the head, ear_*, earTip_* over the top half."
